\newlabel{fig:alpha}{{5}{6}{\textbf {Sensitivity to $\alpha $ on MMMB.} Performance peaks at $\alpha {=}0.2$ and degrades sharply beyond $\alpha {=}0.3$, consistent with prior representation-engineering results \citep {zou-etal-2023-representation}}{figure.caption.27}{}}
